@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Define PLUGIN_ADMIN_TOKEN in the environment inherited by the HTTP client.
@adminToken = {{$processEnv PLUGIN_ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### 1. Listar proveedores externos (inicialmente ALPHA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reflection/plugins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Descriptor con capacidades, versión y hash del artefacto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reflection/plugins/ALPHA
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Inspeccionar clase; repetir para observar cache hit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reflection/plugins/ALPHA/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Procesar tarjeta con ALPHA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-1001",
  "providerCode": "ALPHA",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "currency": "PEN",
  "instrumentType": "CARD",
  "pan": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolder": "Cliente Demo",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### 5. Después de instalar BETA con scripts/install_plugins.py
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reflection/plugins/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. BETA funciona sin reconstruir ni reiniciar el servicio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-1002",
  "providerCode": "BETA",
  "amount": 80,
  "currency": "PEN",
  "instrumentType": "CARD",
  "pan": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolder": "Cliente Demo",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### 7. Billetera con ALPHA (BETA devuelve 400 para este instrumento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-1003",
  "providerCode": "ALPHA",
  "amount": 80,
  "currency": "PEN",
  "instrumentType": "WALLET",
  "walletProvider": "YAPE-DEMO",
  "walletToken": "demo-token"
}

### 8. Transferencia con ALPHA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-1004",
  "providerCode": "ALPHA",
  "amount": 80,
  "currency": "USD",
  "instrumentType": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "bank": "DEMO",
  "accountNumber": "demo-account"
}

### 9. Métricas acumuladas por proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reflection/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Health público de la PoC
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
